于再加工如果脯或晒干。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/malus-micromalus-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"pyrus-bretschneideri","common_name":"白梨","scientific_name":"Pyrus bretschneideri","aliases":["罐梨"],"taxon_group":"蔷薇科 梨属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶卵形，花白色，花药紫红色;梨果倒卵球形，淡黄色，有细密斑点。","habitat_notes":"北京本地有栽培，也常见外地产如安徽、河北的酥梨。","seasonality_notes":"果实成熟后多为黄色，如鸭梨、雪花梨等。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/pyrus-bretschneideri-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"pyrus-ussuriensis","common_name":"秋子梨","scientific_name":"Pyrus ussuriensis","aliases":["酸梨","山梨","花盖梨"],"taxon_group":"蔷薇科 梨属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶卵形，花白色，花药紫红色;梨果近球形，淡黄色或黄绿色，有细密斑点。","habitat_notes":"北京代表品种为京白梨，起源于门头沟区，清代曾作为皇室贡品。","seasonality_notes":"熟透以后口感绵软、味道香甜，不耐贮运。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/pyrus-ussuriensis-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"pyrus-pyrifolia","common_name":"沙梨","scientific_name":"Pyrus pyrifolia","aliases":["糖梨"],"taxon_group":"蔷薇科 梨属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶卵形，花白色，花药紫红色;梨果卵形或近球形，褐色或绿色，有细密斑点。","habitat_notes":"我国山东和南方地区栽培普遍，北京可见“秋月”等品种。","seasonality_notes":"果实颜色多数是褐色或绿色，肉质细密，比较耐储存。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/pyrus-pyrifolia-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"pyrus-communis","common_name":"西洋梨","scientific_name":"Pyrus communis","aliases":["洋梨"],"taxon_group":"蔷薇科 梨属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶卵形，花白色，花药紫红色;梨果倒卵形或近球形，红色或绿色，有细密斑点。","habitat_notes":"原产于欧洲，我国河北、山东一带也有栽培。","seasonality_notes":"有明显的后熟现象，刚采摘时硬而酸涩，放软后味道香甜。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/pyrus-communis-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"crataegus-pinnatifida-var-major","common_name":"山里红","scientific_name":"Crataegus pinnatifida var. major","aliases":["红果","山楂"],"taxon_group":"蔷薇科 山楂属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶羽状深裂，花白色，有腥臭味;梨果近球形，红色。","habitat_notes":"是原变种山楂的栽培变种，北京俗称红果。","seasonality_notes":"味道很酸含水量低，冬季常做成糖葫芦，也加工成果丹皮、山楂糕等。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/crataegus-pinnatifida-var-major-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"eriobotrya-japonica","common_name":"枇杷","scientific_name":"Eriobotrya japonica","aliases":["卢橘"],"taxon_group":"蔷薇科 枇杷属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;枝叶密生褐色绒毛;花白色;梨果近球形或倒卵形，黄色或橙黄色。","habitat_notes":"原产我国南方，北京难开花结果，市面多为南方运来。","seasonality_notes":"春末夏初结果，有红沙和白沙两类，果核含少量毒素。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/eriobotrya-japonica-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"amygdalus-persica","common_name":"桃","scientific_name":"Amygdalus persica","aliases":["桃子","毛桃"],"taxon_group":"蔷薇科 桃属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶长披针形;花淡红色或白色;核果近球形或扁球形，表面有绒毛或光滑，淡红色或黄色。","habitat_notes":"我国栽培历史悠久，北京平谷区种植面积最大。","seasonality_notes":"夏季水果，分为溶质、不溶质和硬质桃，有离核和黏核之分。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/amygdalus-persica-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"armeniaca-vulgaris","common_name":"杏","scientific_name":"Armeniaca vulgaris","aliases":[],"taxon_group":"蔷薇科 杏属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶宽卵形;花淡红色或白色;核果近球形，表面有绒毛，黄色或白色，有时带有红色。","habitat_notes":"北京是重要产地，新疆地区也出产优质的小白杏和树上干杏。","seasonality_notes":"成熟前酸味明显，成熟后甜，部分常被加工成杏脯、杏干。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/armeniaca-vulgaris-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"prunus-salicina","common_name":"中国李","scientific_name":"Prunus salicina","aliases":["李子","嘉应子"],"taxon_group":"蔷薇科 李属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶长椭圆形;花白色;核果近球形，表面光滑，紫色、红色、绿色或黄色。","habitat_notes":"原产我国，南方温暖地区种植普遍，北京传统品种有“晚红”。","seasonality_notes":"供水果鲜食，口感有脆有软。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/prunus-salicina-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"prunus-domestica","common_name":"欧洲李","scientific_name":"Prunus domestica","aliases":["西梅","西洋李"],"taxon_group":"蔷薇科 李属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶长椭圆形;花白色;核果近球形或椭圆形，表面光滑，紫色、红色、绿色或黄色。","habitat_notes":"原产于欧洲，我国仅在新疆有少量引种。","seasonality_notes":"成熟后含糖量高，可直接晒成果干，无需另外加糖。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/prunus-domestica-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"armeniaca-mume","common_name":"梅","scientific_name":"Armeniaca mume","aliases":["梅子","酸梅"],"taxon_group":"蔷薇科 李属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶椭圆形;花淡红色或白色;核果近球形，表面有柔毛，黄色或淡绿色。","habitat_notes":"原产于我国，南方种植较多，北京有少量用于观花。","seasonality_notes":"初夏成熟(梅雨季)，味道极酸不可鲜食，多加工成梅干、乌梅或泡酒。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/armeniaca-mume-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"cerasus-pseudocerasus","common_name":"樱桃","scientific_name":"Cerasus pseudocerasus","aliases":["中国樱桃"],"taxon_group":"蔷薇科 樱属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶卵形;花白色;核果近球形，表面光滑，红色。","habitat_notes":"原产我国，果实小而圆，北京多在本地出售。","seasonality_notes":"外皮极薄、肉质软嫩，不耐长途运输。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/cerasus-pseudocerasus-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"cerasus-avium","common_name":"欧洲甜樱桃","scientific_name":"Cerasus avium","aliases":["车厘子"],"taxon_group":"蔷薇科 樱属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶椭圆卵形;花白色;核果近球形，表面光滑，红色、黄色或紫红色。","habitat_notes":"最早在山东烟台引种，现多地规模化种植。","seasonality_notes":"春末夏初上市，个大皮厚，肉质紧实耐运。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/cerasus-avium-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"fragaria-ananassa","common_name":"草莓","scientific_name":"Fragaria × ananassa","aliases":["凤梨草莓"],"taxon_group":"蔷薇科 草莓属","life_form":"herb","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"草本;茎匍匐;花白色;瘦果多数，生于肉质花托上，花托红色、淡红色或白色。","habitat_notes":"是弗吉尼亚草莓和智利草莓的杂交后代，我国多引种日本高甜度品种。","seasonality_notes":"食用部位是肉质花托，没有后熟现象，必须成熟后采摘。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/fragaria-ananassa-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"rubus-spp","common_name":"树莓","scientific_name":"Rubus spp.","aliases":["黑莓"],"taxon_group":"蔷薇科 悬钩子属","life_form":"shrub","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"灌木;茎有刺;花白色;小核果多数，集生于花托上，与花托连合或分离。","habitat_notes":"分为树莓和黑莓品系，产区主要在东北和华北。","seasonality_notes":"质地娇嫩极易破损，常被提前采收，部分偏酸多用作配料。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/rubus-spp-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"hippophae-rhamnoides","common_name":"沙棘","scientific_name":"Hippophae rhamnoides","aliases":[],"taxon_group":"胡颓子科 沙棘属","life_form":"shrub","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"灌木;叶狭披针形;花黄绿色;坚果核果状，橙黄色。","habitat_notes":"主要生长在我国北部和西部干旱地区，耐寒耐旱。","seasonality_notes":"维生素C含量极高，但极酸带涩，鲜果少见，多加工成果汁。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/hippophae-rhamnoides-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"ziziphus-jujuba","common_name":"枣","scientific_name":"Ziziphus jujuba","aliases":["大枣","小枣","红枣"],"taxon_group":"鼠李科 枣属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶卵状椭圆形，托叶成刺;花黄绿色;核果球形或椭圆形，红色或淡绿色。","habitat_notes":"栽培历史逾3000年，酸枣栽培变种，北京常见果树品种如缨络枣。","seasonality_notes":"秋季鲜食，也可制成干枣、醉枣及糕点用的枣泥。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/ziziphus-jujuba-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"morus-alba","common_name":"桑葚","scientific_name":"Morus alba","aliases":["桑椹"],"taxon_group":"桑科 桑属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶卵形;花序穗状下垂，淡绿色;聚花果紫黑色或白绿色。","habitat_notes":"北京本地有出产，市场常见紫色品种，偶尔可见同属的细长形长果桑。","seasonality_notes":"每年仅初夏大量上市，质地软嫩，极不耐储存。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/morus-alba-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"ficus-carica","common_name":"无花果","scientific_name":"Ficus carica","aliases":[],"taxon_group":"桑科 榕属","life_form":"shrub","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"灌木;叶掌状深裂;隐头花序;许多小果生于壶形肉质花托内，花托紫红色或黄绿色。","habitat_notes":"原产于西亚，北京可越冬但产量不高，市场多为外地产。","seasonality_notes":"食用部位是坛状的花序托，极易破损，可制成果干。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/ficus-carica-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"artocarpus-heterophyllus","common_name":"波罗蜜","scientific_name":"Artocarpus heterophyllus","aliases":["菠萝蜜","树菠萝","木菠萝"],"taxon_group":"桑科 波罗蜜属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶倒卵形;花序椭圆形，生于树干上;聚花果椭圆形，表面有六角形凸起，黄褐色。","habitat_notes":"热带水果，产自广东、广西等地及东南亚国家。","seasonality_notes":"食用宿存花被，有干包和湿包两类，果内黏液多。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/artocarpus-heterophyllus-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"myrica-rubra","common_name":"杨梅","scientific_name":"Myrica rubra","aliases":[],"taxon_group":"杨梅科 杨梅属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶长椭圆形;花红色;核果球形，深红色或紫红色。","habitat_notes":"产于我国南方，果实多数为红色或紫红色。","seasonality_notes":"初夏上市，无硬皮极易腐坏变质，可泡酒或腌制蜜饯。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/myrica-rubra-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"citrullus-lanatus","common_name":"西瓜","scientific_name":"Citrullus lanatus","aliases":[],"taxon_group":"葫芦科 西瓜属","life_form":"vine","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"草质藤本;叶羽状浅裂或深裂;花淡黄色;瓠果球形或椭圆形，光滑，绿色，有些有条纹。","habitat_notes":"由西域传入，北京大兴庞各庄栽培历史悠久，现普及“京欣”等品种。","seasonality_notes":"北京消夏水果，四季都有，食用其发育成的肉质胎座。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/citrullus-lanatus-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"cucumis-melo","common_name":"甜瓜","scientific_name":"Cucumis melo","aliases":["蜜瓜","哈密瓜"],"taxon_group":"葫芦科 黄瓜属","life_form":"vine","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"草质藤本;叶近肾形;花黄色;瓠果球形或椭圆形，光滑或有沟纹，绿色、黄色或褐色。","habitat_notes":"原产非洲，分为长毛甜瓜(新疆哈密瓜类)和短毛甜瓜(香瓜类)。","seasonality_notes":"夏甜瓜有后熟现象，冬甜瓜(白兰瓜等)耐储藏且不后熟。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/cucumis-melo-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"cucumis-metuliferus","common_name":"刺角瓜","scientific_name":"Cucumis metuliferus","aliases":["火参果"],"taxon_group":"葫芦科 黄瓜属","life_form":"vine","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"草质藤本;花黄色;瓠果椭圆形，表面有刺状凸起，黄色。","habitat_notes":"原产于非洲南部沙漠地区，甜瓜和黄瓜的近亲，国内有少量引种。","seasonality_notes":"食用内部凝胶状液化胎座，味道淡微酸，观赏价值大于食用。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/cucumis-metuliferus-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"siraitia-grosvenorii","common_name":"罗汉果","scientific_name":"Siraitia grosvenorii","aliases":["光果木鳖"],"taxon_group":"葫芦科 罗汉果属","life_form":"herb","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"攀援草本;块根纺锤形;叶三角状卵形;花黄色;瓠果球形，绿色。","habitat_notes":"原产于我国华南和西南地区。","seasonality_notes":"多作干果泡水用，含有罗汉果甜苷，甜度极高且热量低。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/siraitia-grosvenorii-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"averrhoa-carambola","common_name":"阳桃","scientific_name":"Averrhoa carambola","aliases":["杨桃","五敛子"],"taxon_group":"酢浆草科 阳桃属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;奇数羽状复叶;花淡红色;浆果5棱，淡绿色或蜡黄色。","habitat_notes":"原产我国南方，多从东南亚引进大果甜品种。","seasonality_notes":"无后熟作用，含草酸，肾病患者不宜食用。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/averrhoa-carambola-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"garcinia-mangostana","common_name":"山竹","scientific_name":"Garcinia mangostana","aliases":["莽吉柿"],"taxon_group":"藤黄科 藤黄属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木，体内具黄色乳汁;叶椭圆形;花橙色;浆果紫红色，光滑。","habitat_notes":"原产东南亚，我国多从泰国、马来西亚进口，被誉为“水果王后”。","seasonality_notes":"采摘后会继续成熟，过熟后外壳僵硬如木。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/garcinia-mangostana-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"passiflora-edulis","common_name":"鸡蛋果","scientific_name":"Passiflora edulis","aliases":["百香果"],"taxon_group":"西番莲科 西番莲属","life_form":"vine","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"草质藤本;叶掌状3深裂;花绿白色，有丝状副花冠;浆果卵形，紫色。","habitat_notes":"原名音译并意译自 passion fruit。","seasonality_notes":"酸味明显，多调饮料，有后熟现象，表皮变皱口味更佳。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/passiflora-edulis-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"punica-granatum","common_name":"石榴","scientific_name":"Punica granatum","aliases":["安石榴"],"taxon_group":"千屈菜科 石榴属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"灌木或乔木;叶矩圆状披针形;花红色;浆果近球形，黄褐色，花萼在顶端宿存。","habitat_notes":"原产中亚，我国栽培悠久，现多食用品种并有软籽石榴。","seasonality_notes":"食用部位为外种皮（种子结构的一部分），不可无籽。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/punica-granatum-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"psidium-guajava","common_name":"番石榴","scientific_name":"Psidium guajava","aliases":["芭乐"],"taxon_group":"桃金娘科 番石榴属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶长圆形;花白色;浆果球形或倒卵形，绿色。","habitat_notes":"原产美洲热带，东南、华南长势良好。","seasonality_notes":"成熟前脆硬，成熟后变软，中心甜，有特殊香气，可蘸酸梅粉食用。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/psidium-guajava-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"syzygium-samarangense","common_name":"莲雾","scientific_name":"Syzygium samarangense","aliases":["洋蒲桃"],"taxon_group":"桃金娘科 蒲桃属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶椭圆形;花白色;果实浆果状，倒圆锥形，淡红色或深红色，顶部凹陷。","habitat_notes":"原产东南亚，我国南方常做行道树，台湾“黑珍珠”等品种多见。","seasonality_notes":"顶端残留花萼需洗净，优质品种肉质清脆且具桉树油清香。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/syzygium-samarangense-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"canarium-album","common_name":"橄榄","scientific_name":"Canarium album","aliases":["青果","白榄"],"taxon_group":"橄榄科 橄榄属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;奇数羽状复叶;花白色;核果纺锤形，内果皮坚硬。","habitat_notes":"原产我国南方，福建、广东出产最多。","seasonality_notes":"初食酸涩后有回甘，常蘸酱油佐饭或制成蜜饯。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/canarium-album-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"mangifera-indica","common_name":"杧果","scientific_name":"Mangifera indica","aliases":["芒果"],"taxon_group":"漆树科 杧果属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶长圆披针形;花黄色;核果肾形或椭圆形，黄色、绿色或红色。","habitat_notes":"原产亚洲热带，常在完全成熟前采摘。","seasonality_notes":"生果易引起过敏，可与苹果同放催熟，常见有桂七、台农1号等。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/mangifera-indica-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"litchi-chinensis","common_name":"荔枝","scientific_name":"Litchi chinensis","aliases":[],"taxon_group":"无患子科 荔枝属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;偶数羽状复叶;花白绿色;果实核果状，暗红色或红色。","habitat_notes":"原产我国南方，古代名“离支”。","seasonality_notes":"食用假种皮，脱水易变质；不可一次过量食用防低血糖。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/litchi-chinensis-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"dimocarpus-longan","common_name":"龙眼","scientific_name":"Dimocarpus longan","aliases":["桂圆"],"taxon_group":"无患子科 龙眼属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;偶数羽状复叶;花乳白色;果实核果状，黄褐色。","habitat_notes":"同科近亲，古时视为滋补佳品。","seasonality_notes":"上市时间略晚于荔枝，果糖极高，也常做成桂圆干。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/dimocarpus-longan-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"nephelium-lappaceum","common_name":"红毛丹","scientific_name":"Nephelium lappaceum","aliases":[],"taxon_group":"无患子科 韶子属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;羽状复叶;花白色;果实核果状，表面有毛状凸起。","habitat_notes":"原产东南亚，我国海南、云南少量种植，市场多为进口。","seasonality_notes":"假种皮常与种皮粘连影响口感，摘后易变色。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/nephelium-lappaceum-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"citrus-japonica","common_name":"金柑","scientific_name":"Citrus japonica","aliases":["金橘"],"taxon_group":"芸香科 柑橘属","life_form":"shrub","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"灌木;单身复叶;花白色;柑果近球形或椭圆形，橙黄色。","habitat_notes":"供鲜食，与观赏用味道偏酸的金橘不同。","seasonality_notes":"连着含有辛辣芳香油的外果皮一起食用，皮肉皆甜。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/citrus-japonica-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"citrus-reticulata","common_name":"柑橘","scientific_name":"Citrus reticulata","aliases":["橘子","柑","蜜橘","蜜柑"],"taxon_group":"芸香科 柑橘属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;单身复叶;花白色;柑果扁圆形，橙色。","habitat_notes":"多为野生品种天然杂交，北京常见砂糖橘、南丰蜜橘、温州蜜柑及椪柑(芦柑)。","seasonality_notes":"冬季上市，剥皮方便，吃其内果皮上的泡状表皮毛。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/citrus-reticulata-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"citrus-maxima","common_name":"柚子","scientific_name":"Citrus maxima","aliases":["文旦"],"taxon_group":"芸香科 柑橘属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;单身复叶;花白色;柑果较大型，倒卵形或近球形，淡黄色或黄绿色。","habitat_notes":"柑橘类原始种，北京常见沙田柚及文旦柚(蜜柚)。","seasonality_notes":"耐储存，久置失水会干硬；皮可制蜂蜜柚子茶。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/citrus-maxima-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"citrus-sinensis","common_name":"甜橙","scientific_name":"Citrus sinensis","aliases":["橙子","广柑"],"taxon_group":"芸香科 柑橘属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;单身复叶;花白色;柑果球形或椭圆形，橙色。","habitat_notes":"原产我国南方，杂交后代，北京常见脐橙及血橙品种。","seasonality_notes":"外皮难剥，味道酸甜，久置易肉干瘪，重者汁水更足。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/citrus-sinensis-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"citrus-paradisi","common_name":"葡萄柚","scientific_name":"Citrus paradisi","aliases":["西柚"],"taxon_group":"芸香科 柑橘属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;单身复叶;花白色;柑果近球形，淡黄色或橙黄色。","habitat_notes":"果实在枝头密集似葡萄；柚子和甜橙天然杂交种。","seasonality_notes":"兼具酸、甜、苦味；同食可干扰他汀等药物的吸收。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/citrus-paradisi-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"citrus-limon","common_name":"柠檬","scientific_name":"Citrus × limon","aliases":[],"taxon_group":"芸香科 柑橘属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;单身复叶;花白色;柑果椭圆形，淡黄色。","habitat_notes":"酸橙与香橼杂交，诞生于南亚；香气来源于外皮。","seasonality_notes":"汁极酸，多作调料；有特殊长绿皮的“香水柠檬”品种。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/citrus-limon-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"citrus-aurantiifolia","common_name":"青柠","scientific_name":"Citrus × aurantiifolia","aliases":["来檬","莱姆"],"taxon_group":"芸香科 柑橘属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;单身复叶;花白色;柑果近球形，绿色。","habitat_notes":"香橼与小花橙的杂交，常与柠檬混淆。","seasonality_notes":"香味清新闻，酸味极烈，多用于调制饮料、鸡尾酒等。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/citrus-aurantiifolia-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"citrus-changshan-huyou","common_name":"常山胡柚","scientific_name":"Citrus × aurantium 'Changshan-huyou'","aliases":["胡柚"],"taxon_group":"芸香科 柑橘属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;单身复叶;花白色;柑果近球形，黄色。","habitat_notes":"浙江常山县特有，其苦味比西柚淡且甜酸明显。","seasonality_notes":"秋末冬初成熟，北京多在冬季或早春销售，极为耐储。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/citrus-changshan-huyou-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"citrus-orah","common_name":"沃柑","scientific_name":"Citrus 'Orah'","aliases":["澳柑"],"taxon_group":"芸香科 柑橘属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;单身复叶;花白色;柑果扁球形，橙色。","habitat_notes":"以色列选育品种，音译为澳柑，四川云南等地有种。","seasonality_notes":"成熟晚，冬末上市；皮薄水多甜度高，但常带核。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/citrus-orah-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"citrus-harumi-shiranui","common_name":"丑橘","scientific_name":"Citrus 'Harumi' Citrus 'Shiranui'","aliases":["丑柑","杂柑","橘橙"],"taxon_group":"芸香科 柑橘属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;单身复叶;花白色;柑果倒卵形或近球形，橙色，表面凹凸不平。","habitat_notes":"四川(如蒲江)主产，常见有“不知火”和“春见”(耙耙柑)。","seasonality_notes":"冬春季上市，外皮松软易剥，多汁脆甜。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/citrus-harumi-shiranui-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"citrus-ehime-28","common_name":"果冻橙","scientific_name":"Citrus '愛媛果試28号'","aliases":["爱媛橙","红美人"],"taxon_group":"芸香科 柑橘属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;单身复叶;花白色;柑果近球形，橙色。","habitat_notes":"源自日本杂交品种，浙江象山、四川等地多有种植。","seasonality_notes":"冬季上市，汁水充足软嫩化渣，口感如软糖果冻。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/citrus-ehime-28-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"clausena-lansium","common_name":"黄皮","scientific_name":"Clausena lansium","aliases":["鸡心果"],"taxon_group":"芸香科 黄皮属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;奇数羽状复叶;花淡黄色;浆果椭圆形，暗黄色，表面有细毛。","habitat_notes":"原产我国南方，外皮带独特刺激性香气。","seasonality_notes":"夏季上市，皮薄不易保存，带有酸甜味道。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/clausena-lansium-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"hibiscus-sabdariffa","common_name":"玫瑰茄","scientific_name":"Hibiscus sabdariffa","aliases":["洛神花"],"taxon_group":"锦葵科 木槿属","life_form":"herb","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"草本;茎直立;叶掌状;花白色或淡红，萼片紫红色。","habitat_notes":"原产非洲西部，1910年引种我国。","seasonality_notes":"食用肉质花萼和苞片，味酸，含花青素可泡水或熬酱。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/hibiscus-sabdariffa-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"durio-zibethinus","common_name":"榴梿","scientific_name":"Durio zibethinus","aliases":["榴莲"],"taxon_group":"锦葵科 榴梿属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;蒴果淡黄色或黄绿色，表面密生短刺状凸起。","habitat_notes":"原产马来、印尼等地，国内目前基本全靠进口，常见“金枕”等。","seasonality_notes":"采摘后会继续成熟发臭，食用部分是假种皮。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/durio-zibethinus-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"carica-papaya","common_name":"番木瓜","scientific_name":"Carica papaya","aliases":["木瓜"],"taxon_group":"番木瓜科 番木瓜属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶聚生于茎顶;浆果长倒卵形，橙黄色。","habitat_notes":"原产美洲热带，明末引入我国华南东南栽培。","seasonality_notes":"含有木瓜蛋白酶，未成熟偏酸可做菜肴，熟后甜软。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/carica-papaya-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"hylocereus-undatus","common_name":"火龙果","scientific_name":"Hylocereus undatus","aliases":["量天尺","霸王花"],"taxon_group":"仙人掌科 量天尺属","life_form":"shrub","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"攀援灌木;浆果紫红色，表面有鳞片状肉质凸起。","habitat_notes":"仙人掌科量天尺果实，原产美洲，华南东南种植。","seasonality_notes":"食用胎座部分，含糖高，分红皮白肉和红肉，还有黄皮品种(燕窝果)。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/hylocereus-undatus-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"diospyros-kaki","common_name":"柿","scientific_name":"Diospyros kaki","aliases":["柿子"],"taxon_group":"柿科 柿属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶卵状椭圆形;花淡黄色;浆果椭圆形或扁圆形，橙色或橙红色。","habitat_notes":"北京秋季重要水果，房山区出产磨盘柿最有名。","seasonality_notes":"分甜柿和涩柿，涩柿需经人工脱涩变软，硬的常被加工为柿饼。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/diospyros-kaki-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"diospyros-lotus","common_name":"君迁子","scientific_name":"Diospyros lotus","aliases":["黑枣"],"taxon_group":"柿科 柿属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶长椭圆形;浆果椭圆形，橙黄色或蓝黑色。","habitat_notes":"柿子的近亲，常做柿子树嫁接的砧木，少部分无核品种供鲜食。","seasonality_notes":"秋冬季上市，软熟变黑后才能吃，否则有明显涩味，常做糖葫芦。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/diospyros-lotus-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"actinidia-chinensis","common_name":"中华猕猴桃","scientific_name":"Actinidia chinensis","aliases":["猕猴桃","奇异果"],"taxon_group":"猕猴桃科 猕猴桃属","life_form":"vine","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"藤本;叶宽卵形;花白色;浆果椭圆形，表面有黄色糙毛。","habitat_notes":"原产我国，分海沃德绿肉、黄肉及自研红心等多个品种。","seasonality_notes":"具有后熟作用，在未全熟偏酸时可与苹果放一起催熟变软变甜。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/actinidia-chinensis-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"actinidia-arguta","common_name":"软枣猕猴桃","scientific_name":"Actinidia arguta","aliases":["软枣子","奇异莓"],"taxon_group":"猕猴桃科 猕猴桃属","life_form":"vine","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"藤本;浆果椭圆形，绿色，光滑。","habitat_notes":"猕猴桃同属植物，东北又称“圆枣子”，逐渐商业化种植。","seasonality_notes":"大小像枣无硬毛，口感如猕猴桃，软烂后可直接吸吮果肉。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/actinidia-arguta-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"vaccinium-spp","common_name":"蓝莓","scientific_name":"Vaccinium spp.","aliases":["北美蓝莓"],"taxon_group":"杜鹃花科 越橘属","life_form":"shrub","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"灌木;叶披针形;花白色;浆果扁球形，蓝紫色。","habitat_notes":"国内引种北美品种(如都克、蓝丰)，在山东半岛和云南有大产区。","seasonality_notes":"自然成熟在夏季，外皮软薄极易受损，偏酸可冷藏变甜。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/vaccinium-spp-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"vaccinium-spp-cranberry","common_name":"蔓越莓","scientific_name":"Vaccinium spp.","aliases":["小红莓"],"taxon_group":"杜鹃花科 越橘属","life_form":"shrub","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"低矮灌木;花淡红色;浆果球形，红色。","habitat_notes":"原产北美沼泽，我国黑龙江抚远亦有种植，有特殊的“水收”方式。","seasonality_notes":"味道纯酸略涩，内部有4个中空气室，市售多做果干或果汁。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/vaccinium-spp-cranberry-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"lycopersicon-esculentum","common_name":"水果番茄","scientific_name":"Lycopersicon esculentum","aliases":["小番茄","樱桃番茄","圣女果"],"taxon_group":"茄科 番茄属","life_form":"herb","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"直立草本;叶羽状深裂;花黄色;浆果扁球形或近球形，橙色或红色。","habitat_notes":"非新选育性状，而是保留了原始番茄强风味基因的小果品种。","seasonality_notes":"香气比蔬菜番茄浓郁，生食味道甜美。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/lycopersicon-esculentum-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"solanum-muricatum","common_name":"香瓜茄","scientific_name":"Solanum muricatum","aliases":["人参果"],"taxon_group":"茄科 茄属","life_form":"herb","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"直立草本;叶长披针形;花白色;浆果椭圆形，黄色且带紫色条纹。","habitat_notes":"原产南美洲安第斯山区，我国20世纪末期引种。","seasonality_notes":"成熟后外皮由白变黄，清甜软糯有哈密瓜香，极易破损不耐贮。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/solanum-muricatum-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"physalis-peruviana","common_name":"灯笼果","scientific_name":"Physalis peruviana","aliases":["姑娘"],"taxon_group":"茄科 酸浆属","life_form":"herb","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"直立草本;浆果球形，橙黄色，外有黄褐色宿存萼片。","habitat_notes":"原产南美，明末传入，北方俗称“姑娘”，外带淡黄色纸状花萼。","seasonality_notes":"秋季上市，味道酸甜具有类似牛奶的独特香味。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/physalis-peruviana-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"lycium-barbarum","common_name":"宁夏枸杞","scientific_name":"Lycium barbarum","aliases":["枸杞子"],"taxon_group":"茄科 枸杞属","life_form":"shrub","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"灌木;叶长圆形;花紫色;浆果椭圆形，红色。","habitat_notes":"植株形似小树，与普通的野生枸杞同属异种，产自宁夏等地。","seasonality_notes":"鲜果略苦，晒干或烘干苦味减轻，可直接食用或泡水不褪色。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/lycium-barbarum-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"smallanthus-sonchifolius","common_name":"雪莲果","scientific_name":"Smallanthus sonchifolius","aliases":["菊薯"],"taxon_group":"菊科 包果菊属","life_form":"herb","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["fruit","edible"],"identification_notes":"直立草本;块茎纺锤形;茎中空;花黄色。","habitat_notes":"原产南美洲安第斯山区，地下块茎形似番薯。","seasonality_notes":"富含低聚果糖，可鲜食或制果干，脆甜多汁，削皮后易氧化变黄。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/smallanthus-sonchifolius-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"ginkgo-biloba","common_name":"银杏","scientific_name":"Ginkgo biloba","aliases":["白果","公孙树","鸭脚子"],"taxon_group":"银杏科 银杏属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["nut","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶扇形;种子卵形，橙黄色。","habitat_notes":"我国特产裸子植物，果实无真花，常作行道树。","seasonality_notes":"脱掉恶臭外种皮后的种子(白果)可食，含氰苷微毒必须熟食限量。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/ginkgo-biloba-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"pinus-koraiensis","common_name":"红松","scientific_name":"Pinus koraiensis","aliases":["朝鲜松","韩松","果松","红果松"],"taxon_group":"松科 松属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["nut","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;针叶5针一束;球果圆锥形;种子红褐色。","habitat_notes":"裸子植物，在我国主要产于东北地区。","seasonality_notes":"厚壳松子的大多来源，生于球果内，成熟掉落可食其种子。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/pinus-koraiensis-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"macadamia-spp","common_name":"澳洲坚果","scientific_name":"Macadamia spp.","aliases":["夏威夷果"],"taxon_group":"山龙眼科 澳洲坚果属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["nut","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;核果球形，绿色，内果皮坚硬。","habitat_notes":"原产澳洲，我国云南、广西产量大，常见有光壳和粗壳两种。","seasonality_notes":"含油脂极高带奶油香，需机器开壳工具撬食，烘烤后果仁易脱壳。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/macadamia-spp-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"arachis-hypogaea","common_name":"落花生","scientific_name":"Arachis hypogaea","aliases":["花生"],"taxon_group":"豆科 落花生属","life_form":"herb","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["nut","edible"],"identification_notes":"草本;偶数羽状复叶;花黄色;荚果圆柱形，膨胀，表面凹凸不平。","habitat_notes":"原产南美洲，明代传入我国，授粉后果实向下钻入土中发育。","seasonality_notes":"供炒、烤或煮食，也是产量极大的油料作物，油脂高不可过量。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/arachis-hypogaea-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"amygdalus-communis","common_name":"扁桃","scientific_name":"Amygdalus communis","aliases":["巴旦杏","美国大杏仁"],"taxon_group":"蔷薇科 桃属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["nut","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;叶披针形;花粉红色;核果扁椭圆形，绿色，表面有绒毛，成熟后开裂。","habitat_notes":"原产中亚西亚地区，现国内常称其加工后的种子为“巴旦木”。","seasonality_notes":"果实干涩不可做水果，成熟后果壳开裂，食用其内部的种仁。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/amygdalus-communis-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"castanea-mollissima","common_name":"栗","scientific_name":"Castanea mollissima","aliases":["板栗","栗子","油栗"],"taxon_group":"壳斗科 栗属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["nut","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;花有腥臭味;坚果外有总苞，总苞上密生锐刺。","habitat_notes":"北京历史名产，常生长在北部山区如怀柔、密云等地。","seasonality_notes":"秋天是新栗上市季节，以“糖炒栗子”的形式在北京最受欢迎。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/castanea-mollissima-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"juglans-regia","common_name":"胡桃","scientific_name":"Juglans regia","aliases":["核桃"],"taxon_group":"胡桃科 胡桃属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["nut","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;奇数羽状复叶;花淡绿色;核果球形，绿色，内果皮坚硬。","habitat_notes":"北京郊区广泛种植，可能是从西域传来或原产于我国西部。","seasonality_notes":"皮带苦涩易染黑手，人工“沤青皮”去皮后获取果仁，常见有纸皮核桃等。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/juglans-regia-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"carya-cathayensis","common_name":"山核桃","scientific_name":"Carya cathayensis","aliases":["山胡桃","小胡桃"],"taxon_group":"胡桃科 山核桃属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["nut","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;奇数羽状复叶;花淡绿色;核果球形，有4棱，内果皮坚硬。","habitat_notes":"产于华东山区，如杭州临安特产，多半野生。","seasonality_notes":"极难剥，个头小油脂高但尤为香甜，常加工成炒熟的净仁售卖。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/carya-cathayensis-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"carya-illinoinensis","common_name":"美国山核桃","scientific_name":"Carya illinoinensis","aliases":["碧根果","长山核桃","薄壳山核桃"],"taxon_group":"胡桃科 山核桃属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["nut","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;奇数羽状复叶;核果长圆形，有4棱，内果皮坚硬。","habitat_notes":"原产北美南部，我国华东、华中规模化种植，常被音译为“碧根果”。","seasonality_notes":"果大壳薄易剥出长圆果仁，多用于直接零食或西式糕点。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/carya-illinoinensis-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"corylus-spp","common_name":"榛子","scientific_name":"Corylus spp.","aliases":[],"taxon_group":"桦木科 榛属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["nut","edible"],"identification_notes":"灌木或小乔木;花下有钟状总苞;坚果卵球形。","habitat_notes":"本地有平榛，但市场大量的是引进自欧洲果大香浓的欧榛。","seasonality_notes":"我国多吃炒制的去壳榛仁，有进口或由平榛和欧榛杂交之品。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/corylus-spp-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"cucurbita-spp","common_name":"南瓜","scientific_name":"Cucurbita spp.","aliases":["北瓜","倭瓜"],"taxon_group":"葫芦科 南瓜属","life_form":"herb","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["nut","edible"],"identification_notes":"蔓生草本;花黄色;瓠果形状多样;种子长卵形。","habitat_notes":"原产美洲，明代中后期传入。","seasonality_notes":"其种子(南瓜子)被专门品种用于炒制零食，有大白板、光板等分。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/cucurbita-spp-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"trichosanthes-kirilowii","common_name":"栝楼","scientific_name":"Trichosanthes kirilowii","aliases":["吊瓜","瓜蒌"],"taxon_group":"葫芦科 栝楼属","life_form":"vine","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["nut","edible"],"identification_notes":"藤本;地下有块根;花白色;瓠果橙色、卵球形。","habitat_notes":"北京原生植物，汁液曾作古妆。","seasonality_notes":"果实极苦不可食用，但内部其种子炒熟(吊瓜子)肉厚具清香。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/trichosanthes-kirilowii-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"pistacia-vera","common_name":"开心果","scientific_name":"Pistacia vera","aliases":["阿月浑子"],"taxon_group":"漆树科 黄连木属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["nut","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;奇数羽状复叶;蒴果长圆形，黄绿色或粉红色，内果皮白色。","habitat_notes":"原产伊朗，国内古称“阿月浑子”。","seasonality_notes":"坚硬外壳(内果皮)成熟后可自然开裂，绿色内仁可食。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/pistacia-vera-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"anacardium-occidentale","common_name":"腰果","scientific_name":"Anacardium occidentale","aliases":[],"taxon_group":"漆树科 腰果属","life_form":"tree","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["nut","edible"],"identification_notes":"乔木;核果肾形;果柄圆锥形、肉质，黄色或红色。","habitat_notes":"原产巴西，我国少种多进口。","seasonality_notes":"果仁弯曲似肾(腰子)，带毒外皮采收已除，底部的肉质果柄在原产地可当水果。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/anacardium-occidentale-1.jpg","is_active":true},{"slug":"helianthus-annuus","common_name":"向日葵","scientific_name":"Helianthus annuus","aliases":["葵花"],"taxon_group":"菊科 向日葵属","life_form":"herb","cultivation_status":"cultivated","plant_uses":["nut","edible"],"identification_notes":"草本;茎直立高大;花黄色;瘦果长倒卵形。","habitat_notes":"原产美洲，因花序盘未熟前向光而得名。","seasonality_notes":"每个瓜子都是一个完整瘦果，去皮后的内部种子为食用物。","cover_image_url":"/fruits/images/helianthus-annuus-1.jpg","is_active":true}]$fruits$::jsonb) AS item(
    slug TEXT,
    common_name TEXT,
    scientific_name TEXT,
    aliases TEXT[],
    taxon_group TEXT,
    life_form TEXT,
    cultivation_status TEXT,
    plant_uses TEXT[],
    identification_notes TEXT,
    habitat_notes TEXT,
    seasonality_notes TEXT,
    cover_image_url TEXT,
    is_active BOOLEAN
  )
),
sanitized_source AS (
  SELECT
    slug,
    common_name,
    NULLIF(scientific_name, '') AS scientific_name,
    COALESCE(aliases, ARRAY[]::TEXT[]) AS aliases,
    NULLIF(taxon_group, '') AS taxon_group,
    'plants'::TEXT AS nature_topic,
    NULLIF(life_form, '') AS life_form,
    COALESCE(NULLIF(cultivation_status, ''), 'cultivated') AS cultivation_status,
    COALESCE(plant_uses, ARRAY[]::TEXT[]) AS plant_uses,
    NULLIF(identification_notes, '') AS identification_notes,
    NULLIF(habitat_notes, '') AS habitat_notes,
    NULLIF(seasonality_notes, '') AS seasonality_notes,
    NULLIF(cover_image_url, '') AS cover_image_url,
    COALESCE(is_active, TRUE) AS is_active
  FROM source
),
updated_species AS (
  UPDATE public.species AS target
     SET aliases = (
           SELECT ARRAY(
             SELECT DISTINCT alias
             FROM unnest(COALESCE(target.aliases, ARRAY[]::TEXT[]) || src.aliases || ARRAY[src.common_name]) AS alias
             WHERE alias IS NOT NULL AND btrim(alias) <> '' AND alias <> target.common_name
             ORDER BY alias
           )
         ),
         nature_topic = src.nature_topic,
         life_form = COALESCE(target.life_form, src.life_form),
         cultivation_status = CASE
           WHEN target.cultivation_status IS NULL OR target.cultivation_status = 'unknown' THEN src.cultivation_status
           WHEN target.cultivation_status = src.cultivation_status THEN target.cultivation_status
           ELSE 'mixed'
         END,
         plant_uses = (
           SELECT ARRAY(
             SELECT DISTINCT plant_use
             FROM unnest(COALESCE(target.plant_uses, ARRAY[]::TEXT[]) || src.plant_uses) AS plant_use
             WHERE plant_use IS NOT NULL AND btrim(plant_use) <> ''
             ORDER BY plant_use
           )
         ),
         updated_at = now()
    FROM sanitized_source AS src
   WHERE target.slug = src.slug
  RETURNING target.id
)
INSERT INTO public.species (
  slug,
  common_name,
  scientific_name,
  aliases,
  taxon_group,
  nature_topic,
  life_form,
  cultivation_status,
  plant_uses,
  identification_notes,
  habitat_notes,
  seasonality_notes,
  cover_image_url,
  is_active
)
SELECT
  src.slug,
  src.common_name,
  src.scientific_name,
  src.aliases,
  src.taxon_group,
  src.nature_topic,
  src.life_form,
  src.cultivation_status,
  src.plant_uses,
  src.identification_notes,
  src.habitat_notes,
  src.seasonality_notes,
  src.cover_image_url,
  src.is_active
FROM sanitized_source AS src
WHERE NOT EXISTS (
  SELECT 1
  FROM public.species AS target
  WHERE target.slug = src.slug
);
